            "specificityGap": "[authn-authz] portal/urls.py:13 exposes views.imports directly, and portal/views.py:77-80 shows the only gate is request.method == \"POST\" plus file presence. There is no login_required, permission decorator, or object/tenant validation before calling import_handoff(), and portal/services.py:40-49 performs Ticket.objects.create(...) for each imported row. Bulk record import is a privileged function, but it is reachable with no convincing authorization guard.",
