                "rationale": "An explicit size cap changes the importer from unbounded memory consumption to bounded memory consumption. Checking upload.size when available and also limiting read() to max_bundle_size + 1 ensures oversized inputs are rejected even if the upload object does not provide trustworthy metadata.",
