            "summary": "`import_handoff()` deserializes an uploaded bundle by calling `pickle.loads(upload.read())`.  \nThe flagged issue is that `upload.read()` loads the entire client-supplied file into memory with\nno repo-visible size limit, chunking, or early rejection. This becomes a security issue if an\nattacker can reach `/imports/` and submit an oversized multipart file to the `bundle` field.",
