            "dataFlowTrace": "`project/urls.py` include(\"\") → `portal/urls.py:<top-level>` →\n`views.ticket_detail(request, ticket_id)` → `get_object_or_404(Ticket,\nid=ticket_id)` at `portal/views.py:46`\n\n- Entry variable: URL path segment `<ticket_id>`\n- View variable: `ticket_id`\n- ORM lookup: `id=ticket_id`\n- Result object: `ticket`\n- Output: `ticket` is rendered into `templates/portal/detail.html`\n\nValidation noted only one check on the path: Django's `<int:...>` converter\nrequires an integer. The provided analysis reports no ownership check against\n`ticket.customer_key`, no `current_customer(request)` call, and no\n`request.user` or permission decorator on this path.",
