            "impact": "A caller who can guess or enumerate valid ticket IDs could read ticket data\noutside their own scope. The validation data states the rendered page includes\nfields such as `customer_name`, `delivery_address`, `robot_unit`, `status`,\n`priority`, `description`, and related notes and attachments.",
