            "debateSummary": "- True positive: 1 model\n- False positive: 0 models\n\nTechnical points raised for the finding:\n- The route is reachable through Django URL dispatch.\n- `ticket_detail()` performs a direct lookup by sequential `id`.\n- The view does not call `current_customer()` or any other ownership check.\n- The rendered template receives the full `ticket` object.\n\nTechnical points raised against or limiting the finding:\n- If the route is intended for fully trusted staff who may view all tickets, the\n  behavior could match policy.\n- Access still requires a valid existing `ticket_id`.\n\nThis review was effectively unchallenged in the supplied transcript; there was\nno opposing model discussion to resolve.",
