                  "markdown": "If this route is intended to show only the caller's own customer tickets, scope\nthe lookup by the same tenant key used elsewhere in the app, for example:\n\n- derive `customer_key = current_customer(request)`\n- fetch with `get_object_or_404(Ticket, id=ticket_id, customer_key=customer_key)`\n\nIf unrestricted cross-customer viewing is intended for this endpoint, that\nauthorization model would need to be explicit and consistent with the rest of\nthe portal's customer-scoped views.",
