            "dataFlowTrace": "- `imports()` in `portal/views.py:77-80`\n  - receives `request.FILES[\"bundle\"]`\n  - checks only that the request is `POST` and that a file is present\n- `import_handoff(upload)` in `portal/services.py:34`\n  - `upload.read()` reads attacker-supplied bytes\n  - `pickle.loads(...)` materializes `rows`\n- loop in `import_handoff()` at `portal/services.py:37`\n  - `row` is taken from unpickled attacker-controlled data\n  - `row.get(\"customer_key\", \"walkup\")` is used unchanged\n- sink: `Ticket.objects.create(... customer_key=...)` at `portal/services.py:42`\n\nValidation noted no check that compares the imported `customer_key` to a trusted server-side\ntenant value, authenticated user state, or an allowlist.",
