                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Treat `body` as literal note text rather than template source in `render_agent_response()`. If\nserver-side templating is needed, use only trusted static templates and pass untrusted reply text as\ndata into those templates instead of compiling the reply text itself.",
                  "text": "Treat `body` as literal note text rather than template source in `render_agent_response()`."
