                "verification": "Before the change, submit a reply body such as '{{ ticket.reference }} / {{ agent }}' to /tickets/<id>/reply/ and observe that the stored/rendered note contains values derived from server-side objects; malformed template syntax may also trigger a TemplateSyntaxError response. After the change, submit the same payload and verify that the note contains the literal characters '{{ ticket.reference }} / {{ agent }}' and that no server-side template evaluation occurs."
