                "description": {
                  "markdown": "Enforce object-level authorization in `views.upload_attachment` before calling\n`save_attachment`, such as scoping the ticket lookup to the current customer or authenticated\nuser instead of querying by `id` alone. The same ticket-ownership check should be applied\nconsistently to `ticket_detail` and other ticket-mutating views that currently accept only\n`ticket_id`.",
                  "text": "Enforce object-level authorization in `views.upload_attachment` before calling `save_attachment`, such as scoping the ticket lookup to the current customer or authenticated user instead of querying b…"
                }
