            "debateSummary": "- True positive: 1 model\n- False positive: 0 models\n\nThe review output argued that the route is publicly reachable, `q` is attacker-controlled,\nand the search path does not apply authentication or customer scoping before querying ticket\nmetadata across customers. No counter-model argued false positive. This was effectively a\nsingle-model debate, so there was no adversarial disagreement to resolve.",
            "end_line": 9,
            "fileSourceUrl": "https://github.com/caldova-io/support-portal/blob/1b68f887d82551e0d429c29bafbc3d11639c0700/portal/urls.py#L9",
