                "rationale": "Using request.get_signed_cookie() causes Django to verify that the customer_key value was issued by the server and was not modified by the client. Rejecting missing or invalid values removes the attacker-controlled fallback path, so the queryset in inbox() is no longer scoped by an arbitrary client-supplied tenant identifier.",
