                  "markdown": "Bind `customer_key` on the server from a trusted identity source, such as authenticated tenant\ncontext or server-managed session state, and do not accept it from POST data. If opening tickets\nfor another customer is intended behavior, that operation would need an explicit authorization\ncheck; the current `current_customer()` helper is not sufficient because it reads an unsigned\ncookie.",
