            "debateSummary": "- Provided transcript: 1 model argued true positive, 0 argued false positive\n- Validation metadata records debate consensus as TP\n- Technical arguments for TP:\n  - `ReplyForm` and `Ticket.status` only enforce the global enum, not per-state transitions\n  - `workflow.allowed_statuses()` exists, and `resolved` has no allowed next states\n  - `allowed_statuses()` is used in `ticket_detail()` for display, not enforcement in `reply()`\n- Counterpoint raised in self-challenge:\n  - The UI exposes allowed next steps and the endpoint may be intended for trusted staff\n- Limitation:\n  - The detailed panel transcript includes one analyzer plus self-challenge, so the full debate\n    composition is not shown",
