            "severitySource": "validator",
            "summary": "`reply()` handles `POST /tickets/<ticket_id>/reply/`, creates a `TicketNote`, and saves the\nsubmitted `status` onto the `Ticket`. The scanner flagged that the handler accepts any status\nvalue from the form's global choice list without checking whether that transition is allowed\nfrom the ticket's current state. This becomes a security issue if actors who can reach this\nendpoint are not intended to override workflow rules, such as reopening a `resolved` ticket.",
