            "prerequisites": "- Two or more requests must attempt ticket creation concurrently.\n- The route is exposed as `path(\"tickets/new/\", views.new_ticket, name=\"new_ticket\")` and is\n  included by the project URL configuration, so this handler is part of the normal web surface,\n  not an optional extension.\n- No authentication, permission decorator, transaction wrapper, or explicit serialization guard\n  was identified on this path in the provided code.\n- The trust boundary is network/client input crossing into persistent ticket creation.\n- The supplied threat model describes ticket persistence as a boundary reachable by a remote\n  unauthenticated submitter or low-privilege user, but it does not describe this specific\n  reference-generation pattern.",
